<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Quản trị dự án | Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/software/logo.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=20260527-brief-submit-align" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login.css?v=20260527-admin-login" />
</head>
<body class="admin-page">
  <main class="admin-shell">
    <header class="admin-topbar">
      <a class="login-brand" href="/" aria-label="Về trang chủ">HS<span>.</span></a>
      <form action="/logout" method="POST">
        <button class="admin-logout" type="submit">Đăng xuất</button>
      </form>
    </header>
    <section class="admin-board">
      <p class="login-kicker">Project Admin</p>
      <% if (user && (user.name || user.username || user.email)) { %>
        <p class="admin-user">Dang dang nhap: <strong><%= user.name || user.username || user.email %></strong></p>
      <% } %>
      <h1>Quản trị dự án</h1>
      <p>Khu vực quản trị đã được bảo vệ bằng đăng nhập. Bạn có thể gắn các tính năng quản lý dự án vào trang này.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
